Mainline U-Boot v2026.10 support for the Xunlei OneCloud (Amlogic S805 /
Meson8b).  This adds a 32-bit Meson8b platform, the OneCloud board, a minimal
U-Boot device tree, a polled meson-mx-sdio MMC driver, the Meson6 timer, and
the Amlogic vendor-SPL compatibility magic at offset 60 of the U-Boot proper
image.  The port is built as U-Boot proper only and is loaded by the working
vendor SPL/DDR firmware.

